# Ed25519 signing PRIVATE keys — never commit (dev keys are regenerated locally;
# production keys are mounted from HSM/Vault/k8s Secret). Verification only needs
# the .pub files under config/*/_keys/. Blocks pre-commit secret-scanner flags.
*.ed25519.priv

# nginx api.conf is generated at container start by docker-entrypoint.sh from
# api.conf.template (envsubst of CORS map + gateway API key). Tracking the
# rendered output causes drift and `git pull` conflicts on servers where the
# entrypoint rewrites it in-place (bind-mounted conf.d). The template is the
# single source of truth.
infra/nginx/conf.d/api.conf

